35 0 obj
<<
/Title (Insight: The analysis shows that most customers have low brand diversity: 5,148 customers are classified as Low Diversity, compared with 2,914 Medium Diversity and 590 High Diversity customers. The number of brands purchased ranges from 2 to 83, with an average of about 20 brands per customer. This indicates that while most customers purchase from a relatively limited range of brands, a smaller group demonstrates much broader purchasing diversity.)
/Dest [30 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 524 0 R
>>
